  "description": "Syncfusion® ASP.NET MVC Ribbon control provides a Microsoft Office-style tabbed command bar for organizing and accessing application features efficiently. It supports tabs, groups, button items, split buttons, dropdown buttons, toggles, combo boxes, color pickers, and gallery items. The control offers simplified and classic layout modes, responsive behavior, keyboard navigation, tooltip support, and accessibility compliance. It is ideal for document editors, productivity tools, and enterprise applications built on ASP.NET MVC that require a structured toolbar experience.",
